WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/system/components/CommandInputDialog.tsx — a CONTROLLED FORM MODAL. Props:
    open / onClose / onSubmit(values) / def:CommandDef / vehicle?:{display_name} / loading?.
  Composition: <Modal size="sm"> → header[ def.icon chip + t(def.labelKey) + t(ic.promptKey) ]
               → <form>{ fields ? fields.map(<Input/>) : single <Input/> }
                 + footer[ Cancel ghost (t('common.cancel')) · Send primary (t('common.send'), loading,
                           disabled={!isValid()}) ].
  validateField(value, validation, min, max):
    !trim ⇒ 'Required' ; pin ⇒ /^\d{4}$/ ; number ⇒ parseInt(10), String(n)!==v ⇒ 'Enter a whole number',
    then min/max ; decimal ⇒ parseFloat, NaN ⇒ 'Enter a valid number', then min/max ; text/none ⇒ ok.
  resolveInputType: pin ⇒ password (secure) ; resolveInputMode: pin/number ⇒ numeric, decimal ⇒ decimal.
  Initial values: fields ⇒ each '' ; single ⇒ getDefaultValue?.({vehicle}) ?? defaultValue ?? ''.
  Per-field error shows only when touched; Escape ⇒ onClose; first input is focused on open.
  DATA SOURCES (from the prompt + a full read of the source): ONLY useTranslation. The component
  FETCHES NOTHING — there is no async data axis, hence no empty / error / stale / offline FETCH states.
  The branches the source ACTUALLY has (all reproduced): single-field vs multi-field, per-field
  validation error (touched-gated), the submit-in-flight `loading` state, and the validity gate.

