PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  <Modal size="sm">       → a 420-pt rounded surface card (Color.TS.surface + .border stroke + shadow),
                            hosted in a native sheet via .commandInputDialog(model:isPresented:).
  header icon chip        → 40×40 SF Symbol chip on Color.TS.surfaceGlass (decorative, a11yHidden).
  t(def.labelKey)/prompt  → CommandInputStrings.string(def.labelKey/ic.promptKey, fallback) (P1/S10).
  <Input> label/error     → label (Font.TS.label) + native TextField/SecureField + inline error
                            (Color.TS.statusDanger), shown only when the model marks the field touched.
  resolveInputType=pass   → SecureField when validation==.pin ; resolveInputMode → .keyboardType on iOS
                            (numberPad / decimalPad), a no-op on macOS (#if os(iOS)).
  Cancel ghost / Send     → plain Button (textSecondary) + accent-tinted Capsule Button (Color.TS.accent
                            /.18 fill, /.30 ring) — the web neon-cyan Send mapped to the accent token; the
                            Send spinner reflects `loading`; disabled until isValid (+ a double-submit guard).
  getDefaultValue closure → CommandDefault enum {none, literal, vehicleDisplayName}. The web catalog has
                            EXACTLY ONE getDefaultValue (set_vehicle_name → vehicle.display_name), so the
                            closed enum is FULL parity, not a reduction (verified: 1 hit in commands.ts).
  validateField prose     → semantic CommandFieldError enum localized at the P1/S10 boundary; min/max
                            magnitudes round-trip via plainNumber to read like the web `${min}` template.
  i18n      : every string from P1/S10 keys; ZERO English literals in code (validation prose promoted to
              keys). Title/prompt resolve via the caller's CommandDef keys.
  a11y      : icon chip decorative; header reads as one element; every field has an accessibilityLabel +
              value; the error is announced; Cancel/Send carry labels + .cancelAction/.defaultAction
              shortcuts (Escape / Return). No nonessential motion → Reduce Motion safe by construction.
  telemetry : view.opened surface="CommandInputDialog" emitted once on first presentation (P1/S11).

